---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = '2026-05-08';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Screening Clearing privacy policy. Your health data stays on your device. We do not collect, store, or share your personal information."
>
  <article class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#f1f5f9] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[#64748b] text-sm mb-10">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-teal max-w-none prose-p:text-[#cbd5e1] prose-headings:text-[#f1f5f9] prose-a:text-[#06b6d4]">

      <h2>Summary</h2>
      <p>Screening Clearing is an offline-first app. <strong>Your health data never leaves your device.</strong> We do not create accounts, do not collect personal health information, and do not share any data with third parties.</p>

      <h2>Data We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <p>The Screening Clearing app does not collect, transmit, or store any of the following on our servers:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name, email address, or any contact information</li>
        <li>Your health history, screening records, or appointment data</li>
        <li>Your age, gender, or any profile information you enter in the app</li>
        <li>Location data</li>
        <li>Device identifiers for tracking purposes</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Stored Locally on Your Device</h2>
      <p>All data you enter in Screening Clearing — including your profile, health history, and appointment records — is stored exclusively on your device using local device storage. This data is not accessible to us and is not transmitted over the internet.</p>

      <h2>Analytics (This Website Only)</h2>
      <p>This website (screeningclearing.com) uses Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use the site. This analytics data is collected only with your consent via our cookie banner. It does not include any health data from the app. You can opt out at any time using the cookie settings in the footer.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>The app uses RevenueCat to process in-app purchases. RevenueCat processes transaction data necessary to fulfil purchases. No health data is shared with RevenueCat. Please refer to <a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RevenueCat's Privacy Policy</a> for details on their data handling.</p>

      <h2>Push Notifications</h2>
      <p>If you grant notification permission, the app sends local notifications from your device. These notifications are generated on-device and do not involve any server communication.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Screening Clearing is not directed at children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect any data from children.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Since we do not collect personal data from the app, there is no data held by us to access, correct, or delete. To remove all data associated with Screening Clearing, simply delete the app from your device.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:screeningclearing@gmail.com">screeningclearing@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
